  "body": "Found by MYCF711 in their #3749 patch (pr/small-seats). In the \"Several accounts or keys\" list on the Routing page, each provider row sets `row.title = p.who.join(\", \")` on the whole `.rt-pool` row (internal/gui/assets/plugins/routing/client.js, at `row.title = p.who.join`). Segment buttons without a title of their own inherit it, so hovering Routing or Stays shows the account names instead of anything about the button.\n\nFix: put the tooltip on the name cell (`nm.title`), as their patch does, plus a GUI test that hovering a Routing segment doesn't show the account list. Not part of #3749's fix, so it gets its own commit.",
