   "body": "Branch, rebased on `508911e4`:\n\n```\ngit fetch https://github.com/MYCF711/magpie.git pr/pool-tooltip\n```\n\nOne line: the account list moves from the row (`row.title`) to the name cell (`nm.title`), and the row carries none of its own — so a control with no title of its own no longer inherits the accounts. Plus `internal/gui/tests/routing-pool-tooltip.test.cjs`, which asserts what hover resolves to up from each button rather than the row's attribute.\n\nChecked by hand in Chromium against these assets, one provider over four accounts:\n\n```\n                       before                             after\n.rt-pool      title = \"…, …, …, …\"                 null\n.rt-pool .nm  title = null                         \"…, …, …, …\"\nRouting/Stays nearest title = the account list      null (each button shows only its own)\n```\n\nAll 14 controls in the row, Routing and Stays included, resolve to no title; the \"Rate limited\" segment keeps the hint it sets itself.\n\nNot run: the new test — no Playwright on this Windows machine. Its 5 languages x 2 widths x 2 engines are unrun here.\n",
