   "body": "Confirmed — the shipped fix is the intended one: the account list is now the name cell's tooltip, and Routing / Stays keep only their own hints (the \"Rate limited\" segment keeps its own). It also closes the gap in my `pr/pool-tooltip` branch, whose test matrix I couldn't run here (no Playwright on this Windows box) — f2b4b9894 covers chromium + webkit x en/zh.\n\nNothing further from me. Fixed as far as I'm concerned — the close is yours, GitHub won't let me set it on someone else's issue. Thanks skygunner for the patch, yetone for picking it up.",
